sentences.text:
3. Learned counsel for the appellants seeks enhancement of compensation inter alia on the grounds:
a) that learned Tribunal has granted interest @ 9% per annum whereas the same should be 18%;
b) that learned Tribunal has failed to appreciate that the deceased was 51 years of age at the time of accident and has "awarded very less multiplier".
c) that learned Tribunal has assessed income of the deceased on lower side;
2 of 5 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:064942 d) that only 15% future prospects have been added which is on lower side.

